{"3179350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Long Drive North: Co-Op RV Simulator", "steam_appid": 3179350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive, maintain, explore, scavenge, upgrade and hunt to survive the Long Drive North.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive and maintain your trusty old RV: get hands on and refuel &amp; repair your vehicle </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive an unforgiving world: manage your sleep, hunger and thirst levels, scavenge for parts, and hunt for food </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use recipes and cook to survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and customise your RV: scavenge engine, battery and wheel upgrades, install appliances like the stove and microwave, and make your vehicle your own with spray paint, liveries and bobbleheads. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the wilderness: discover a post-disaster American wilderness, an open world, sandbox environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or in up to 4 player co-op multiplayer. Share an RV between you or journey in four separate RVs – the choice is yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the frontier on-foot and behind the wheel. Can you conquer the wilderness and survive your desperate journey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long Drive North is inspired by the likes of <i>The Long Dark</i>, <i>The Long Drive</i> and <i>My Summer Car</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179350/extras/aa508930a944ef1c1be35fd6fc89dc66.poster.avif?t=1782747959\" aria-label=\"A short, looping video showing driving an RV through a snowy environment in 1st person with smoke rising from the bonnet. The smoking engine parts under the hood are then shown.\" width=780 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179350/extras/aa508930a944ef1c1be35fd6fc89dc66.webm?t=1782747959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179350/extras/aa508930a944ef1c1be35fd6fc89dc66.mp4?t=1782747959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your RV may be old and a little worn out, but it’s still a reliable vehicle. The motorhome will provide you with refuge, so you’ll need to give it a little loving maintenance in return. Get your hands dirty and get under the hood to repair and refuel your RV in this automobile simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179350/extras/10fb37b007d0e8499097467296854d95.poster.avif?t=1782747959\" aria-label=\"A clip of 1st person hunting. The player character&#039;s arm and a rifle can be seen, as the player approaches a watchtower. Then the video cuts to showing a deer and the character shoots.\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179350/extras/10fb37b007d0e8499097467296854d95.webm?t=1782747959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179350/extras/10fb37b007d0e8499097467296854d95.mp4?t=1782747959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re a long way from home, lost in unfamiliar, dangerous territory. Scavenge for parts from abandoned cars and decrepit buildings. Equip your hunting rifle and go hunting with your dog companion – get crafty with recipes and cook food to survive your road trip. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage sleep, hunger and thirst levels to survive a desperate and brutal journey through an unforgiving, harsh environment. Face the elements and keep an eye out to avoid a dangerous recurring storm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179350/extras/15e3ef37de3226cfbef05bd28f1fc00b.poster.avif?t=1782747959\" aria-label=\"A video showing multiple RVs driving along a road in a convoy in a snowy American wilderness environment. The video then cuts to show four RVs parked up on an overlook, with a campfire lit nearby.\" width=780 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179350/extras/15e3ef37de3226cfbef05bd28f1fc00b.webm?t=1782747959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179350/extras/15e3ef37de3226cfbef05bd28f1fc00b.mp4?t=1782747959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the frontier on foot and behind the wheel. Navigate post-disaster American wilderness and discover what awaits in this open world, sandbox environment.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive, maintain, explore, scavenge, upgrade and hunt to survive the Long Drive North.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive and maintain your trusty old RV: get hands on and refuel &amp; repair your vehicle </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive an unforgiving world: manage your sleep, hunger and thirst levels, scavenge for parts, and hunt for food </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use recipes and cook to survive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade and customise your RV: scavenge engine, battery and wheel upgrades, install appliances like the stove and microwave, and make your vehicle your own with spray paint, liveries and bobbleheads. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the wilderness: discover a post-disaster American wilderness, an open world, sandbox environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or in up to 4 player co-op multiplayer. Share an RV between you or journey in four separate RVs – the choice is yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the frontier on-foot and behind the wheel. Can you conquer the wilderness and survive your desperate journey?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long Drive North is inspired by the likes of <i>The Long Dark</i>, <i>The Long Drive</i> and <i>My Summer Car</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179350/extras/aa508930a944ef1c1be35fd6fc89dc66.poster.avif?t=1782747959\" aria-label=\"A short, looping video showing driving an RV through a snowy environment in 1st person with smoke rising from the bonnet. The smoking engine parts under the hood are then shown.\" width=780 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179350/extras/aa508930a944ef1c1be35fd6fc89dc66.webm?t=1782747959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179350/extras/aa508930a944ef1c1be35fd6fc89dc66.mp4?t=1782747959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your RV may be old and a little worn out, but it’s still a reliable vehicle. The motorhome will provide you with refuge, so you’ll need to give it a little loving maintenance in return. Get your hands dirty and get under the hood to repair and refuel your RV in this automobile simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179350/extras/10fb37b007d0e8499097467296854d95.poster.avif?t=1782747959\" aria-label=\"A clip of 1st person hunting. The player character&#039;s arm and a rifle can be seen, as the player approaches a watchtower. Then the video cuts to showing a deer and the character shoots.\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179350/extras/10fb37b007d0e8499097467296854d95.webm?t=1782747959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179350/extras/10fb37b007d0e8499097467296854d95.mp4?t=1782747959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re a long way from home, lost in unfamiliar, dangerous territory. Scavenge for parts from abandoned cars and decrepit buildings. Equip your hunting rifle and go hunting with your dog companion – get crafty with recipes and cook food to survive your road trip. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage sleep, hunger and thirst levels to survive a desperate and brutal journey through an unforgiving, harsh environment. Face the elements and keep an eye out to avoid a dangerous recurring storm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179350/extras/15e3ef37de3226cfbef05bd28f1fc00b.poster.avif?t=1782747959\" aria-label=\"A video showing multiple RVs driving along a road in a convoy in a snowy American wilderness environment. The video then cuts to show four RVs parked up on an overlook, with a campfire lit nearby.\" width=780 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3179350/extras/15e3ef37de3226cfbef05bd28f1fc00b.webm?t=1782747959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"h